<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="protection-warrior-sindragosa-progression-p3-bis">Protection Warrior - Sindragosa Progression (P3 BiS)</h4>This Sindragosa progression set is optimized for highest survivability during a 60 seconds tanking window in Phase 3 before tank swap (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=70127/mystic-buffet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_arcane03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mystic Buffet</span></a> + 3x <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=73061/frost-breath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_frostnova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frost Breath</span></a>).<br/>• 341 Frost Resistance with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44939/lesser-flask-of-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_118.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lesser Flask of Resistance</span></a>
<br/>• 14.08% Expertise with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=42994/rhinolicious-wormsteak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_food_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rhinolicious Wormsteak</span></a> <i>(complete parry-haste removal)</i></div>
