<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>Both ilvl 277 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50640/broken-ram-skull-helm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_151.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Broken Ram Skull Helm</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51221/sanctified-ymirjar-lords-greathelm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_158.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ymirjar Lord's Greathelm</span></a> are excellent. The former is slightly more threat-oriented with a lot of hit rating, while the latter is the best mitigation helmet in the game with the defense/<wbr/>dodge/<wbr/>parry combo of secondary stats. If you acquire the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50640/broken-ram-skull-helm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_151.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Broken Ram Skull Helm</span></a> first, it would be best to save your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=52029/protectors-mark-of-sanctification">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_judgementsofthejust.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Protector's Mark of Sanctification</span></a> to upgrade other T10 parts first.<br/>
<br/>In the meantime, the ilvl 264 version of these two items are also equal and a small upgrade to the P3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48433/wrynns-greathelm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Greathelm of Triumph</span></a>. The base version ilvl 251 of the T10 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51774/ymirjar-lords-greathelm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_158.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ymirjar Lord's Greathelm</span></a> is simply not worth equipping if you already own the ilvl 258 T9.<ul>
<li class="fa fa-lightbulb-o">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<i>Each time you upgrade your helmet slot, make sure to re-purpose the previous one into a special <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
