<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>The ilvl 277 T10 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51220/sanctified-ymirjar-lords-breastplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ymirjar Lord's Breastplate</span></a> is the best mitigation chest by a long shot thanks to its extremely valuable bonus armor. <br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50681/blightborne-warplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blightborne Warplate</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36627/rotface">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Rotface</span></a>, one of the easiest heroic encounters, is a strong upgrade to Phase 3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46968/chestplate-of-the-towering-monstrosity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestplate of the Towering Monstrosity</span></a> if you get it early, but ultimately you will want to use the T10 chest for the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=70844">4-piece set bonus</a> starting from the ilvl 264 version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51219/sanctified-ymirjar-lords-breastplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ymirjar Lord's Breastplate</span></a>.<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50968/cataclysmic-chestguard">
