<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> for the same reason.<br/>
<br/>Until you can upgrade your T10 to ilvl 264, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51917/ghoul-commanders-cuirass">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ghoul Commander's Cuirass</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50024/blightborne-warplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blightborne Warplate</span></a> are good immediate upgrades to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46968/chestplate-of-the-towering-monstrosity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestplate of the Towering Monstrosity</span></a> and worth equipping over the ilvl 251 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50850/ymirjar-lords-breastplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ymirjar Lord's Breastplate</span></a> still. However, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50850/ymirjar-lords-breastplate">
