<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>Similarly to chests, the ilvl 277 T10 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51222/sanctified-ymirjar-lords-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ymirjar Lord's Handguards</span></a> are the best gloves overall by a long margin thanks to their bonus armor, as well as the best mitigation gloves in spite of some item budget converted into hit rating.<br/>
<br/>As a second choice, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50716/taldarams-plated-fists">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Taldaram's Plated Fists</span></a> are also a strong mitigation-oriented item if you get them early into the phase and before you start using 4 parts T10, with more stamina than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51222/sanctified-ymirjar-lords-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Ymirjar Lord's Handguards</span></a> but still lower EHP due to the lower armor.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50978/gauntlets-of-the-kraken">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of the Kraken</span></a> are on par with the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50716/taldarams-plated-fists">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Taldaram's Plated Fists</span></a> but I can not recommend spending <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> on it. <br/>
<br/>The base 251 T10 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50849/ymirjar-lords-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ymirjar Lord's Handguards</span></a> are one of the rare items that are a direct upgrade to Phase 3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48453/wrynns-handguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Handguards of Triumph</span></a>, although it is not recommended to break the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67273">4 parts T9 bonus</a> until you have at least 4 parts of T10 to equip.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reticulated Armor Webbing</span></a> (Engineers only), <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44529/enchant-gloves-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Major Agility</span></a>
