<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>Just like the belt slot, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50625/grinning-skull-greatboots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grinning Skull Greatboots</span></a> are the only ilvl 277 pair of boots this phase and therefore the default BiS due to their superior item budget. They are the best boots overall thanks to their high expertise, as well as best mitigation boots since none of the boots added this phase have all mitigation-oriented secondary stats but all carry hit rating or expertise instead.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51816/scourge-fanged-stompers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scourge Fanged Stompers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50190/grinning-skull-greatboots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grinning Skull Greatboots</span></a> are almost identical, with a slight advantage for the former due to its two blue sockets.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49907/boots-of-kingly-upheaval">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Kingly Upheaval</span></a>, however, are one step below in spite of their similar item level, due to the lack of defense in its secondary stats. Because of this flaw, they end up being barely a sidegrade to Phase 3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47003/dawnbreaker-greaves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dawnbreaker Greaves</span></a> and worth considering only if you have ilvl 245-251 alternatives and want to spend money on the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=70568">craft</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
