<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>The ilvl 277 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50682/bile-encrusted-medallion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaceb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bile-Encrusted Medallion</span></a> is the only substantial upgrade to the already great Phase 3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47133/the-arbiters-muse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Arbiter's Muse</span></a> thanks to its bonus armor, and its ilvl 264 version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50023/bile-encrusted-medallion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaceb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bile-Encrusted Medallion</span></a> is a small upgrade as well.<br/>The other ilvl 277 neck <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50627/noose-of-malachite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklacec.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Noose of Malachite</span></a> can't rival in the mitigation department due to its lack of bonus armor. However, it is a worthwhile alternative as the only neck with hit rating in several phases, should you need it for a more threat-oriented gear set.<br/>
<br/>The ilvl 264 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51934/marrowgars-scratching-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Marrowgar's Scratching Choker</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50195/noose-of-malachite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklacec.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Noose of Malachite</span></a> are downgrades to Phase 3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47133/the-arbiters-muse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Arbiter's Muse</span></a> and only worth considering if you are using an ilvl 245 necklace.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47116/the-arbiters-muse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Arbiter's Muse</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49492/eskhandars-links">
