<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50622/deviums-eternally-cold-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Devium's Eternally Cold Ring</span></a> is the best ring of Phase 4 due to its high bonus armor, paired with the best secondary stats for damage mitigation. The ilvl 264 version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50185/deviums-eternally-cold-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Devium's Eternally Cold Ring</span></a> is a close second, although you can only equip one at a time. The best second ring therefore becomes the ilvl 277 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50642/juggernaut-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringd.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Juggernaut Band</span></a>, with similar primary stats to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50622/deviums-eternally-cold-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Devium's Eternally Cold Ring</span></a> but less valuable avoidance in place of bonus armor.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50404/ashen-band-of-endless-courage">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Courage</span></a> is a decent, guaranteed upgrade in the early weeks of Phase 4 if you are willing to grind your reputation with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1156/the-ashen-verdict">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ashen Verdict</span></a>. However, it pales in comparison to other ilvl 277 rings and performs closer to a good ilvl 264 rings. The main reason for that is the low amount of primary stats, strength and stamina, as a result of some item budget being traded for the addition of the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=72415">armor proc</a>, which in the end is lackluster and inconsistent against bosses due to its low 3% proc chance and measly 7% average uptime. Even if you need the hit rating, using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40166/vivid-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vivid Eye of Zul</span></a> in place of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40167/enduring-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enduring Eye of Zul</span></a> in your yellow sockets is a better route than using the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50404/ashen-band-of-endless-courage">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Courage</span></a> once you have superior rings available.<br/>Its ilvl 268 version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50403/ashen-band-of-unmatched-courage">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Unmatched Courage</span></a>, available at Revered, is held back by the lack of a gem socket and is roughly equal to the ilvl 258 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47157/signet-of-the-traitor-king">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Traitor King</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51913/abominations-bloody-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Abomination's Bloody Ring</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50447/harbingers-bone-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Harbinger's Bone Band</span></a> are other hit rating alternatives, although they also have low primary stats as a result of more item budget allocated to secondary stats. All of these, as well as the ilvl 264 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49985/juggernaut-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringd.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Juggernaut Band</span></a>, are sidegrades to the Phase 3 BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47955/loop-of-the-twin-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_59.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Loop of the Twin Val'kyr</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
