<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ranged">Ranged Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</h3>The <b>heroic</b> version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51834/dreamhunters-carbine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamhunter's Carbine</span></a> is the best ranged weapon with tank stats thanks to its gem socket skyrocketing its total stamina compared to other ilvl 264 weapons.<br/>The BoE ilvl 264 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50444/rowans-rifle-of-silver-bullets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rowan's Rifle of Silver Bullets</span></a> is a small upgrade to the ilvl 251 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51561/dreamhunters-carbine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamhunter's Carbine</span></a>, with similar mitigation scores but an edge in the threat department for the former with some hit rating, should you need it.<br/>In the meantime, most ilvl 251 to 277 ranged weapons are also upgrades to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47660/blades-of-the-sable-cross">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingaxepvp320_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blades of the Sable Cross</span></a> and worth considering, as long as you don't step on the toes of any DPS class and especially not <a class="icontiny c3" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/hunter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_hunter.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hunter</span></a> weapons.<br/>
